---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Our farm" description="See how Vermicompost Farm turns pre-composted horse manure and wood shavings into living black gold in Pretoria.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Our farm" title="Small farm. Millions of workers." intro="A practical, hands-on operation where red wigglers quietly turn local organic material into healthier soil." image="/farm/windrows.jpg" />
  <section class="section story"><div class="container story-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">The farm story</p><h2>We let nature do the complicated part.</h2></div><div class="story-copy"><p class="lede">Vermicompost Farm specialises in castings made by red wigglers—Eisenia fetida—along with a small amount of stable organic matter.</p><p>Horse manure and wood shavings are pre-composted for several weeks before being fed to the worms. Over roughly ten weeks, they transform that material into nutrient-rich vermicast.</p><p>The result is a natural soil conditioner with water-soluble nutrients and living beneficial microbes. Gardeners know it by a simpler name: black gold.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="gallery container" aria-label="Farm gallery"><figure class="gallery-tall"><img src="/farm/worm-bins-open.jpg" alt="Open worm production bins" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The working bins</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/farm/trommel-sifter.jpg" alt="Three millimetre trommel sifter" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Three millimetre sifting</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/farm/red-wigglers.jpg" alt="Red wiggler worms in bedding" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Eisenia fetida</figcaption></figure></section>
  <section class="section values"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Farm principles</p><h2>Care for the system,<br />not just the crop.</h2></div><p class="lede">Healthy soil is a living community. Our job is to prepare good material, protect the organisms and give them enough time.</p></div><div class="value-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Use local resources</h3><p>Turn useful organic materials into something gardens need.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Protect living biology</h3><p>Handle castings and tea in ways that support their microbial value.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Teach what works</h3><p>Share practical experience so more people can compost successfully.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="visit-band"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">Come and see it</p><h2>The best explanation is a working worm bin.</h2></div><a class="button button--paper" href="/visit">Plan a farm visit <span>→</span></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .story-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(50px, 9vw, 130px); }.story h2 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5.2rem); }.story-copy > p:not(.lede) { color: var(--muted); }.gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr; grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; padding-bottom: clamp(90px, 12vw, 150px); }.gallery figure { position: relative; min-height: 310px; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }.gallery-tall { grid-row: 1 / 3; }.gallery img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: saturate(.8); }.gallery figcaption { position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; padding: 10px 14px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--soil); font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; }.values { background: var(--white); }.value-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }.value-grid article { min-height: 260px; padding: 32px; border-right: 1px solid var(--rule); }.value-grid article:last-child { border: 0; }.value-grid span { color: var(--clay); font-family: var(--serif); }.value-grid h3 { margin-top: 40px; font-size: 1.8rem; }.value-grid p { margin-top: 12px; color: var(--muted); }.visit-band { padding: 86px 0; background: var(--green-dark); color: var(--white); }.visit-band .container { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 60px; }.visit-band .eyebrow { color: #d5dfd1; }.visit-band h2 { max-width: 760px; font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5.4rem); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .story-grid, .gallery, .value-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.gallery { grid-template-rows: auto; }.gallery-tall { grid-row: auto; }.gallery figure { min-height: 280px; }.value-grid article { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }.visit-band .container { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; } }
</style>

